    "title": "Is McDonald's, Whataburger open on Easter Sunday?",
    "text": "Whataburger.Courtesy of Whataburger Easter Sunday has arrived once again, and people will be gathering for egg hunts, cascarones fights and cookouts around Texas and across the United States. But there are, of course, people who don't celebrate as well as some who grow tired of chocolate eggs and whatever side dishes their family is serving for dinner. That's where fast food chains come in. If you're looking for a quick bite outside of the party and finger foods, several national and regional chains have you covered. Here's a list of the fast food restaurants that are open on Easter Sunday, April 5.Article continues below this adYes, Whataburger will be open on Easter Sunday, as most locations are open 24 hours a day. McDonald's cheeseburger and fries.Courtesy of McDonald'sIs McDonald's open on Easter Sunday?The consensus is that most McDonald's locations will be open on Easter Sunday, but it's a good idea to check your preferred location's hours in advance. Article continues below this adIs Taco Palenque open on Easter Sunday?Taco Palenque has historically remained open on Easter Sunday.Is Starbucks open on Easter Sunday?You can count on most Starbucks stores to be open on Easter Sunday, but it doesn't hurt to check on store hours before heading to your nearest location.Article continues below this adChick-fil-A.Courtesy of Chick-fil-AIs Chick-fil-A open on Easter Sunday?Is Taco Bell open on Easter Sunday?Yes, Taco Bell will be open on Easter Sunday. Article continues below this adIs Sonic Drive-In open on Easter Sunday?Some Sonic Drive-In locations will be closed on Easter Sunday, while others will stay open with varying hours. You can check the restaurant chain's website for specific location hours. Chipotle.Google MapsIs Chipotle open on Easter Sunday?Chipotle employees have confirmed on Reddit that the company tends to sit out on major holidays, including Easter Sunday.Article continues below this adIs In-N-Out Burger open on Easter Sunday?Hours may vary between locations at In-N-Out Burger on Easter Sunday, but you can check your nearest location to see if they are open. Is Wingstop open on Easter Sunday?It's a good idea to call ahead if you're trying to get Wingstop on Easter Sunday, as most locations will be closed for the holiday.Article continues below this adIs Burger King open on Easter Sunday?Burger King store hours vary between locations. Use the Burger King store locator to check the hours at a specific restaurant. Is KFC open on Easter Sunday?Hours are likely to vary between KFC locations, so expect to call ahead or check online before heading out for fried chicken.April 5, 2026Polly Anna Rocha is a food writer from San Antonio, Texas. She earned her BA in creative writing from Texas State University in 2015. Her work can be seen in Teen Vogue, Eater, Thrillist, Autostraddle, Them, Out In SA, San Antonio Magazine, San Antonio Current and San Antonio Express-News.",
